" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# firebase.yaml&#10;test:&#10;  instrumentation:&#10;    app: app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk&#10;    test: app/build/outputs/apk/androidTest/debug/app-debug-androidTest.apk&#10;    device:&#10;      - model: Pixel6&#10;        version: 33&#10;        locale: zh_CN&#10;      - model: SamsungS23&#10;        version: 34&#10;        locale: zh_CN&#10;    environment-variables:&#10;      - DEEPLINK_TEST_URL=https://example.com/product/123\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># firebase.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  instrumentation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app/build/outputs/apk/androidTest/debug/app-debug-androidTest.apk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    device</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Pixel6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">33</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        locale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">zh_CN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SamsungS23</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">34</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        locale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">zh_CN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment-variables</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DEEPLINK_TEST_URL=https://example.com/product/123</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"aasa-和-assetlinks-json-生产验证\">AASA 和 assetlinks.json 生产验证</h2><p>服务端配置文件的可访问性需要定期监控：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>URL</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Apple AASA 验证器</td>\n<td>检查 AASA 格式和可访问性</td>\n<td><code>https://branch.io/resources/aasa-validator/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google Digital Asset Links API</td>\n<td>验证 assetlinks.json</td>\n<td><code>https://digitalassetlinks.googleapis.com/v1/statements:list?source.web.site=https://example.com&amp;relation=delegate_permission/common.handle_all_urls</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Branch Link 验证器</td>\n<td>端到端 Branch 链接测试</td>\n<td>Branch Dashboard → Link Testing</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>AASA 验证的 Shell 脚本示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/bin/bash&#10;DOMAIN=&quot;example.com&quot;&#10;AASA_URL=&quot;https://${DOMAIN}/.well-known/apple-app-site-association&quot;&#10;&#10;# 检查 HTTP 状态码&#10;HTTP_STATUS=$(curl -o /dev/null -s -w &quot;%{http_code}&quot; &quot;${AASA_URL}&quot;)&#10;if [ &quot;$HTTP_STATUS&quot; != &quot;200&quot; ]; then&#10;    echo &quot;FAIL: AASA returned HTTP ${HTTP_STATUS}&quot;&#10;    exit 1&#10;fi&#10;&#10;# 检查 Content-Type&#10;CONTENT_TYPE=$(curl -sI &quot;${AASA_URL}&quot; | grep -i content-type)&#10;if [[ &quot;$CONTENT_TYPE&quot; != *&quot;application/json&quot;* ]]; then&#10;    echo &quot;FAIL: Content-Type is not application/json&quot;&#10;    exit 1&#10;fi&#10;&#10;# 验证 JSON 格式&#10;curl -s &quot;${AASA_URL}&quot; | python3 -m json.tool &gt; /dev/null&#10;if [ $? -ne 0 ]; then&#10;    echo &quot;FAIL: AASA is not valid JSON&quot;&#10;    exit 1&#10;fi&#10;&#10;echo &quot;PASS: AASA is accessible and valid&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DOMAIN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"example.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">AASA_URL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DOMAIN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}/.well-known/apple-app-site-association\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查 HTTP 状态码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">HTTP_STATUS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dev/null</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"%{http_code}\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">AASA_URL</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$HTTP_STATUS</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"200\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"FAIL: AASA returned HTTP ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">HTTP_STATUS</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    exit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查 Content-Type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CONTENT_TYPE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -sI</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">AASA_URL</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> content-type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [[ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$CONTENT_TYPE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"FAIL: Content-Type is not application/json\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    exit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 验证 JSON 格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">AASA_URL</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> python3</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> json.tool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dev/null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$?</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -ne</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"FAIL: AASA is not valid JSON\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    exit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"PASS: AASA is accessible and valid\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>将此脚本加入 CI/CD 流水线，在每次部署后自动运行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>深链测试的工程实践要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>路由逻辑单测覆盖</strong>：所有路由解析逻辑必须有单元测试，包括有效路径、无效路径和边界参数（特殊字符、超长 ID、缺失参数）</li>\n<li><strong>冷热启动均覆盖</strong>：端到端测试必须同时覆盖 App 从未运行状态（冷启动）和 App 在后台（热启动）的两个场景</li>\n<li><strong>AASA / assetlinks.json 纳入 CI</strong>：在部署流水线中加入服务端配置验证，防止 CDN 更新或配置迁移导致的静默失败</li>\n<li><strong>多设备 / 多版本</strong>：通过 Firebase Test Lab 或 Sauce Labs 覆盖不同 Android 版本和设备型号，特别是 Android App Links 验证在不同 OEM 设备上的行为差异</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章相关文档：</strong> <a href=\"analytics-attribution\">分析与归因</a> 介绍深链数据的分析体系；<a href=\"link-migration-versioning\">迁移与版本管理</a> 介绍链接结构变更的安全管理方式。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"深链测试","id":"深链测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"深链测试的四个层次","id":"深链测试的四个层次"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 深链的单元测试","id":"ios-深链的单元测试"},{"level":2,"text":"XCUITest 深链端到端测试","id":"xcuitest-深链端到端测试"},{"level":2,"text":"Android Espresso 深链测试","id":"android-espresso-深链测试"},{"level":2,"text":"Firebase Test Lab 集成","id":"firebase-test-lab-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"AASA 和 assetlinks.json 生产验证","id":"aasa-和-assetlinks-json-生产验证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Web-to-App 路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/implementation/web-to-app-routing"},"next":{"title":"分析与归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/engineering/analytics-attribution"}}